{"id":"set-intersection-union","html":"<section id=\"entries\"><h2>知识条目</h2><article class=\"entry\" id=\"intersection\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">定义</p><h3>交集 <a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#intersection\" aria-label=\"定位到交集\">#</a></h3><p><span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi><mtext> 且 </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A\\cap B=\\{x\\mid x\\in A\\text{ 且 }x\\in B\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">且</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span>。</span>交集保留同时属于两个集合的元素；没有共同元素时交集为空集。</p><p class=\"condition\"><strong>成立条件：</strong>集合中的元素类型一致，能够判断每个元素的归属。</p></article><article class=\"entry\" id=\"union\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">定义</p><h3>并集 <a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#union\" aria-label=\"定位到并集\">#</a></h3><p><span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi><mtext> 或 </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A\\cup B=\\{x\\mid x\\in A\\text{ 或 }x\\in B\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">或</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span>。</span>这里的“或”包含同时属于两个集合；共同元素在并集中只记一次。</p><p>多个合法条件同时成立时取交集；不同分段或不同情况给出的全部取值合并时取并集。</p><p class=\"condition\"><strong>成立条件：</strong>合并各集合时保留每个元素的实际归属，不能填入原集合之外的元素。</p></article></section>"}
